      "source": "https://portlandky.org/history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The museum displays models, life‑size characters, photographs and film to narrate Portland’s river‑town past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.gotolouisville.com/neighborhoods/portland/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Portland once thrived as an independent river city, ferrying people and goods across the Falls of Ohio.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.gotolouisville.com/neighborhoods/portland/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Nearby, the U.S. Marine Hospital is a National Historic Landmark and the best‑remaining antebellum hospital in the country.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.gotolouisville.com/neighborhoods/portland/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "From the McAlpine Locks and Dam viewing station, you can watch riverboats lock through the Falls of Ohio.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.gotolouisville.com/neighborhoods/portland/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Portland Museum’s permanent exhibit spans more than 200 years of the neighborhood’s rich history, complemented by rotating art galleries.",
